{"publicId":"3f04a9c2-0f72-4ab8-ac46-5de3a8e60805","title":"怪兽饮料蛋白粉业务成新增长点，股价估值争议持续","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T11:47:34.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T11:47:34.000Z","digest":"怪兽饮料推出蛋白粉产品，成为其新增长引擎，但股价估值仍被机构认为偏高。\n据2026年11月11日Seeking Alpha报道，该公司通过跨界合作进入蛋白粉市场，目前该业务贡献营收占比约8%，同比增长120%。\n机构分析指出，市场分歧主要源于蛋白粉业务毛利率（65%）虽高于饮料主业务（42%），但短期产能扩张可能导致未来6-12个月行业价格战，且现有市盈率（35倍）高于行业均值（28倍）。\n早前2026年9月财报曾披露该业务试销期间复购率达73%，但未说明具体合作方及渠道覆盖范围。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T12:25:05.176Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"怪兽饮料：蛋白粉成为新增长引擎，但股价仍偏贵","latestReport":{"id":"uziy57p3wrdd2unjt4brcccej"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"ftNmvMAmcshk","title":"怪兽饮料：蛋白粉成为新增长引擎，但股价仍偏贵","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T11:47:34.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"uziy57p3wrdd2unjt4brcccej","title":"怪兽饮料：蛋白粉成为新增长引擎，但股价仍偏贵","summary":"怪兽饮料推出蛋白粉产品，成为新的增长点，但股价估值仍偏高。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:47:34.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"uziy57p3wrdd2unjt4brcccej","title":"怪兽饮料：蛋白粉成为新增长引擎，但股价仍偏贵","summary":"怪兽饮料推出蛋白粉产品，成为新的增长点，但股价估值仍偏高。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:47:34.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T13:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","